            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 1–10</h3><p>Complete the notes below.</p><p>Write <strong>ONE WORD ONLY</strong> for each answer.</p>",
            "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"summary\"><div class=\"notes-title\">Watertown Community Centre Programmes</div><p><em>Example</em>&nbsp;&nbsp;Name of staff member: Maria</p><div class=\"sub-head\">Yoga</div><ul class=\"notes-list\"> <li>&lsquo;Modern Yoga&rsquo; is good for losing {{1}}.</li> <li>&lsquo;Yoga and More&rsquo; is beneficial for those with aches in their {{2}}.</li> <li>&lsquo;Original Yoga&rsquo; is great for {{3}}.</li> <li>Classes last for 55 minutes.</li> <li>Participants should bring a {{4}}.</li> </ul><div class=\"sub-head\">Ballet</div><ul class=\"notes-list\"> <li>The Wednesday class focuses on difficult routines and {{5}}.</li> <li>The Thursday class is preparing for a {{6}}.</li> </ul><div class=\"sub-head\">Soccer</div><ul class=\"notes-list\"> <li>In the Rookies team, the children learn the main skills of soccer.</li> <li>Parents bring a {{7}} to be shared.</li> </ul><div class=\"sub-head\">Aerobics</div><ul class=\"notes-list\"> <li>Classes are held 16 times a week.</li> <li>It&rsquo;s best to go before {{8}} instead of later.</li> <li>High-impact aerobics helps maintain a strong {{9}}.</li> </ul><div class=\"sub-head\">Registration procedures</div><ul class=\"notes-list\"> <li>Can pay online or at {{10}} in the centre.</li> <li>$360 for 12 weeks.</li> </ul></div>"
          }
        ]
      },
