            "selectCount": 2,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 11 and 12</h3><p>Choose <strong>TWO</strong> letters, <strong>A–E</strong>.</p><p>Which <strong>TWO</strong> facts are given about the lake in the Royal Nature Park?</p>",
